1
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,337
YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,417
YAMU! YAMU!

3
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,840
YAMU!

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,500
Y 'all move!

5
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:05,377
you were a fool to
challenge me wheeler now

6
00:01:05,460 --> 00:01:08,417
maybe you'll realize what i knew all along

7
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:11,577
you are worthless and you shouldn't have

8
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:14,237
been in my tournament
in the first place now

9
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:16,677
then go ahead and make your move because

10
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:20,277
you've wasted enough of
my time already look i

11
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:23,197
finished in the top
four and so did you and

12
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:26,660
once i win this duel
i'll outrank you My move!

13
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:29,224
If only winning were that easy.

14
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:32,820
But first, I gotta destroy
his blue-eyes white dragon.

15
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:37,337
This card could help, but it's gonna
take a little luck and a lot of faith.

16
00:01:37,420 --> 00:01:40,440
Now I summon baby dragon in defense mode!

17
00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:43,500
That's all, folks.

18
00:01:44,220 --> 00:01:46,632
All right, Joey's gonna need our support.

19
00:01:46,780 --> 00:01:48,900
So where's Yugi? Huh?

20
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:51,788
And Teya, they should
have been back by now.

21
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:53,194
Yeah, that's not cool.

22
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,515
Joey needs all of us.

23
00:01:58,140 --> 00:02:01,020
So Merrick's good side does still exist.

24
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:06,100
Yes, and he was able to confront his
dark side by controlling Taya's body.

25
00:02:07,580 --> 00:02:09,860
But the good Merrick is weak,

26
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:14,549
and he'll grow weaker with every passing
second until the shadows engulf him.

27
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:18,717
Please, Pharaoh, don't allow the
evil within my brother to prosper.

28
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:22,397
You can destroy it by
defeating Merrick in your

29
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:25,880
next duel and stopping him
from gaining your power.

30
00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:28,010
I will.

31
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,880
Thank you, my Pharaoh.

32
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,920
I know that you will prevail.

33
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,340
You have to.

34
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:37,340
Otherwise, the world will crumble.

35
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:38,820
Shizu's right!

36
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:42,800
Yes, if we are victorious
against Marek's dark side,

37
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:45,600
we'll gain all three Egyptian god cards.

38
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,760
But if we lose, they're his.

39
00:02:48,220 --> 00:02:50,777
And he'll also get the Millennium Puzzle,

40
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:54,160
Giving him everything he
needs to absorb your power!

41
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:59,040
I promise you, I shall save the
world from Merrick's evil, Ashizu.

42
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:01,580
And save your brother from himself.

43
00:03:01,900 --> 00:03:06,429
I just hope that defeating him will also
reverse the damage that's been done.

44
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,070
Hmm.

45
00:03:08,153 --> 00:03:08,983
So do I.

46
00:03:14,060 --> 00:03:14,890
Teya!

47
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,960
Hey, what's going on?

48
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,120
Why am I up here?

49
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:19,417
Are you all right?

50
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:23,120
Yeah, but I still don't
know how I got here.

51
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:26,496
The last thing I remember
is watching Joey duel Kaiba.

52
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:30,840
My blue eyes is ready
to devour you, Wheeler.

53
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:33,480
This doesn't look good. Yeah,

54
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:36,457
Joey's life points may
be protected right now,

55
00:03:36,540 --> 00:03:39,657
but none of his monsters
are strong enough to attack.

56
00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:42,220
He better think of something and quick.

57
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:47,480
Time to erase what's left of
your life points. With what?

58
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,080
With this, Wheeler.

59
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:50,520
Stop defense!

60
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:53,400
Switching your knight into attack mode!

61
00:03:53,860 --> 00:03:56,240
He's wide open now! Yes!

62
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,720
Now Seto's gonna win!

63
00:03:57,940 --> 00:03:59,500
Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

64
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:03,200
Wipe out Joey's knight and
the rest of his life points!

65
00:04:14,260 --> 00:04:15,420
It's over!

66
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:18,900
I told you, you're way out of your league!

67
00:04:20,020 --> 00:04:21,700
Don't be so sure!

68
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:24,880
Watch this! Now! Reveal!

69
00:04:25,020 --> 00:04:26,620
Trap card! Oh no!

70
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:28,300
Yeah, I'm afraid so!

71
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:29,740
Meet Nutrient Z!

72
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:33,337
It works whenever I'm about to
lose 2,000 or more life points!

73
00:04:33,420 --> 00:04:37,340
It gives my strength a 4,000 point
boost before your attack hits!

74
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:39,670
Awesome!

75
00:04:39,753 --> 00:04:41,497
Pretty swift thinking there, Joey!

76
00:04:41,580 --> 00:04:44,637
Yeah, now you have more
life points than Kaiba does!

77
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:47,249
So, what was that you
were saying about me?

78
00:04:47,340 --> 00:04:48,960
I said you're an amateur!

79
00:04:49,900 --> 00:04:52,920
I'll place one card face
down and end my turn.

80
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:56,320
Making one decent move
doesn't impress me, Wheeler.

81
00:04:56,660 --> 00:04:58,920
The next turn will be your last.

82
00:05:02,140 --> 00:05:06,440
It's a long shot, but I know I can
beat Kaiba and shut him up for good.

83
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:09,080
I just need to draw the right card.

84
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:12,140
And if I don't, he wins.

85
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:17,697
Alright, my move.

86
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:19,600
Only one card can save me.

87
00:05:20,940 --> 00:05:22,000
Yeah! Jackpot!

88
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,200
Read it and wink, Kyber!

89
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,120
I play Time Wizard!

90
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:30,340
Your plan will never work. Oh, no?

91
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:32,377
We'll just see about that, won't we?

92
00:05:32,460 --> 00:05:35,097
I still got one more
chance to take you down.

93
00:05:35,180 --> 00:05:37,220
So, Time Wizard, go!

94
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:45,340
If this works, Kyber's blue eyes
will crumble while my dragon grows!

95
00:05:46,300 --> 00:05:47,740
It's too risky!

96
00:05:48,300 --> 00:05:50,241
Joey could lose all his monsters.

97
00:05:50,820 --> 00:05:52,960
And Seto could lose his blue eyes.

98
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:55,940
Come on.

99
00:05:56,500 --> 00:05:58,897
No skulls, baby, no skulls.

100
00:05:58,980 --> 00:06:00,000
He's finished.

101
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:03,140
No. No!

102
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:04,590
Yes!

103
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:07,040
All right, in your face!

104
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:09,400
Thanks to my time wizard,

105
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:13,597
the calendar is speeding up, causing
my baby dragon to age a thousand years.

106
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,720
And with age comes experience.

107
00:06:16,340 --> 00:06:18,480
They grow up so fast, don't they?

108
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:21,257
But there comes a time
when you gotta let go.

109
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:23,280
So goodbye, baby dragon.

110
00:06:24,300 --> 00:06:25,653
Hello, thousand dragon.

111
00:06:30,500 --> 00:06:31,580
That's too bad.

112
00:06:31,900 --> 00:06:34,497
I guess time just wasn't
on your side, Kaiba.

113
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:37,874
Now let's see what a thousand
years does to your dragon.

114
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:44,134
If he thinks he can win the
duel with this little stunt,

115
00:06:44,340 --> 00:06:46,516
he's more of a novice than I thought.

116
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,660
I did it?

117
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:52,860
All right!

118
00:06:53,060 --> 00:06:56,037
Looks like time took its
toll on Kaiba's blue eyes.

119
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:58,473
Take a close look at the field, Wheeler.

120
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,580
Now, blue eyes, return to me.

121
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,577
Say, what?

122
00:07:06,660 --> 00:07:08,720
Oh, man, no way.

123
00:07:08,980 --> 00:07:10,560
Oh, Blue Eyes is back.

124
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:14,780
Thanks to my interdimensional
matter transporter,

125
00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:19,900
my monster dematerialized just before
your time wizard was able to affect it.

126
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:25,360
And now he's back, just in time to tear
your thousand dragon to shreds, Wheeler.

127
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:28,560
Excellent move, Seto. That's nuts.

128
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:30,333
Joey had this duel won.

129
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:34,717
You may depend on luck to win your
duels, but I depend on my skills.

130
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:37,020
That's the difference between us!

131
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:41,860
You really kill me, you know that?

132
00:07:42,820 --> 00:07:43,920
You've lost it.

133
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:45,670
Wrong.

134
00:07:45,753 --> 00:07:48,080
I just find you ridiculous. Come on.

135
00:07:48,300 --> 00:07:49,780
I mean, lighten up, man.

136
00:07:50,020 --> 00:07:52,817
Look, you and I are fighting
a great duel right here.

137
00:07:52,900 --> 00:07:54,540
So relax and have fun.

138
00:07:54,780 --> 00:07:56,080
I don't have fun.

139
00:07:56,340 --> 00:08:01,097
Then I guess you're an even more miserable
person than I thought you were, Kyber.

140
00:08:01,180 --> 00:08:02,957
You don't know anything about me.

141
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:06,920
I dueled to gain power and to
be the best, not to have fun.

142
00:08:07,180 --> 00:08:11,620
But when Yugi beat me, he
stole my glory once again!

143
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,340
You were good, but Yugi was better.

144
00:08:19,140 --> 00:08:21,669
I just don't see why
you can't accept that.

145
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:24,840
I wouldn't expect someone
like you to understand.

146
00:08:25,340 --> 00:08:26,440
What's that mean?

147
00:08:26,660 --> 00:08:28,307
Let's just move on, Wheeler.

148
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,657
My move, now!

149
00:08:30,740 --> 00:08:36,740
Now, I'll discard my Thunder Dragon in
order to activate its special ability.

150
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:39,900
This lets me draw two
more Thunder Dragons.

151
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:44,000
Then I'll use Polymerization
to fuse them together.

152
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:52,780
Now, meet my twin-headed Thunder Dragon.

153
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,380
Next, I play Quick Attack!

154
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:08,500
This card allows my new monster
to attack you immediately!

155
00:09:10,140 --> 00:09:12,740
You have no chance against my dragons!

156
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:14,220
This duel's over!

157
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:17,740
Thanks, Yugi.

158
00:09:19,260 --> 00:09:21,966
I'm still a little freaked
out about all this.

159
00:09:22,380 --> 00:09:28,220
I mean, I never sleepwalk, especially
not during the day, and for over a mile?

160
00:09:28,780 --> 00:09:31,077
Maybe I should tell Taya
that Merrick took over

161
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:33,748
her mind so he could
confront his evil side.

162
00:09:33,860 --> 00:09:35,840
On second thought, maybe not.

163
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:38,500
Hey, wait.

164
00:09:38,820 --> 00:09:41,879
Did Joey ever finish his
duel against Kaiba or what?

165
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:43,390
No.

166
00:09:43,473 --> 00:09:45,520
I left while the duel
was still in progress.

167
00:09:45,940 --> 00:09:48,764
If we hurry, we should
get there before it ends.

168
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:53,200
I'd never let a hack like you defeat me!

169
00:09:53,540 --> 00:09:57,840
Twin-headed Thunder Dragon,
attack his Thousand Dragon now!

170
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,560
He's my last hope.

171
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:16,620
Now for your life points.

172
00:10:16,980 --> 00:10:20,820
Blue-eyes White Dragon, attack
him directly and wipe him out!

173
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:25,060
Looks like I win!

174
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:26,820
I guess this is it.

175
00:10:37,260 --> 00:10:39,460
That's right, bow down and defeat!

176
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,660
You did it, Seto!

177
00:10:45,140 --> 00:10:49,860
Hey, Joey, you did okay, but you're still
no match for my brother, right, Seto?

178
00:10:50,700 --> 00:10:54,340
Out-dueling Joey Wheeler is
no cause for celebration.

179
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:57,097
I could have beaten him blindfolded.

180
00:10:57,180 --> 00:10:59,040
What a waste of my time.

181
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:03,140
Hold on, Kyber. Relax.

182
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:07,640
Wheeler, can't you just
let it go? It's over.

183
00:11:08,020 --> 00:11:10,120
No, it's not over, Kyber.

184
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:13,400
It's never over.

185
00:11:13,660 --> 00:11:14,940
Not for me, anyway.

186
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,558
You may have beaten me in this duel.

187
00:11:17,700 --> 00:11:20,257
And you may even beat me
in the next duel, too.

188
00:11:20,340 --> 00:11:23,340
But I'm gonna keep coming
back until I win, Kyber.

189
00:11:23,900 --> 00:11:26,580
That's because Joey
Wheeler doesn't give up.

190
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:30,840
You'll never have the skills
to defeat me. Aw, yeah?

191
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:33,727
I'll show you some
skills, you stuck-up punk!

192
00:11:33,860 --> 00:11:34,920
Forget him, Joey!

193
00:11:35,260 --> 00:11:37,436
Yeah, he's not worth the effort, man.

194
00:11:37,660 --> 00:11:38,778
You guys are right.

195
00:11:38,940 --> 00:11:40,840
I dueled my best out there.

196
00:11:41,060 --> 00:11:44,000
And I made that rich boy
sweat a few times, too.

197
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:45,600
Yeah, let's go.

198
00:11:45,780 --> 00:11:48,117
Hey, come to think of it,
where's Yugi and Taya?

199
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:50,117
They didn't stick around
to see my big finish?

200
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,141
That's not cool.

201
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:53,140
Let's go, Mokuba.

202
00:11:53,420 --> 00:11:56,097
There's no reason to stick
around this dump anymore.

203
00:11:56,180 --> 00:11:58,340
But there's still one more duel!

204
00:12:00,300 --> 00:12:02,360
What do you want, Ishizu?

205
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:07,228
I would advise you to be present for the
final duel of your tournament, Kaiba.

206
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:11,521
Yugi will need your help to defeat
Merrick and fulfill his destiny.

207
00:12:11,700 --> 00:12:12,540
No thanks.

208
00:12:12,820 --> 00:12:14,820
As far as I'm concerned, I'm done.

209
00:12:15,340 --> 00:12:19,987
Battle City's over for me, and the sooner
I put this all behind me, the better.

210
00:12:20,180 --> 00:12:25,460
I've had about all I can take of you people,
so leave me alone and have a nice life!

211
00:12:26,020 --> 00:12:27,120
Kaiba, wait.

212
00:12:27,540 --> 00:12:30,000
Walking away now is a huge mistake.

213
00:12:30,920 --> 00:12:31,750
Really?

214
00:12:31,833 --> 00:12:34,240
And why is that a Shizu? Let me guess.

215
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:37,237
You read about it in one of
your ancient fairy tales.

216
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,261
Come on, Mokuba.

217
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,900
Your future's at stake.

218
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:47,320
And deep down, you know
that as well as I do, right?

219
00:12:47,680 --> 00:12:50,877
I know you are able to read
the ancient Egyptian text,

220
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:54,077
and you're well aware of
what is written on the stone.

221
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:58,940
The sorcerer may have been the pharaoh's
rival, but he was also his friend.

222
00:12:59,940 --> 00:13:02,140
The sorcerer is you, Kaiba,

223
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:06,680
and you must do for Yugi what you
did for the pharaoh 5,000 years ago.

224
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:08,560
Help your friend.

225
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:12,096
Without you, he can't save
the world from destruction.

226
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:13,160
Heh. Goodbye.

227
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:17,659
Don't you realize that if you continue
to deny your ancient heritage,

228
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:21,420
the entire world will suffer
because of your stubbornness?

229
00:13:22,220 --> 00:13:26,220
Your rivalry with Yugi has been in
existence for thousands of years.

230
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:30,360
And it will continue
to exist for eternity.

231
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:35,360
As a skilled sorcerer, you
constantly challenge the pharaoh,

232
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:37,497
strengthening his skills in battle.

233
00:13:37,580 --> 00:13:41,756
And it was with your help that the
pharaoh was able to save his people.

234
00:13:42,780 --> 00:13:45,300
History is now repeating itself, Kaiba.

235
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:47,160
Yugi needs you.

236
00:13:47,940 --> 00:13:49,657
That's enough, Ishizu.

237
00:13:49,740 --> 00:13:54,660
I hosted this tournament so I could
become number one, not to help Yugi.

238
00:13:55,260 --> 00:13:56,090
Wrong.

239
00:13:56,173 --> 00:13:58,880
You were destined to
organize this event, Kaiba,

240
00:13:59,060 --> 00:14:01,178
and you had no choice in the matter.

241
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:04,097
You were guided by a
force beyond your control,

242
00:14:04,180 --> 00:14:07,768
and if you leave now, you'll be
turning your back on mankind.

243
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:14,600
That dual tower stands as a
symbol of my hatred for my father.

244
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:18,160
I can't stand the sight
of it, Ishizu. I see.

245
00:14:18,300 --> 00:14:19,653
That's why you must go.

246
00:14:19,740 --> 00:14:21,446
To run away from your father?

247
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:26,960
Don't you realize that this is about more
than just you and your family, Kaiba? No.

248
00:14:27,340 --> 00:14:29,281
I designed this whole tournament.

249
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:32,140
And I was robbed of my victory.

250
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:36,880
But I can still bury my past
by destroying that duel tower.

251
00:14:37,940 --> 00:14:40,180
Mokuba, prepare for detonation.

252
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:42,960
Mokuba, did you hear me?

253
00:14:43,380 --> 00:14:47,157
I heard you, but I don't think destroying
the tower is going to solve anything.

254
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:51,534
All it's gonna do is cause more
destruction, more anger, and more hatred.

255
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:52,820
Ugh, Mokuba.

256
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:56,480
I think what Yugi said about you is right.

257
00:14:56,660 --> 00:14:58,072
You're filled with hate.

258
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:01,620
You battle for all the
wrong reasons, Kaiba.

259
00:15:02,520 --> 00:15:07,080
Fueled by your anger, your
hate, your jealousy, your rage.

260
00:15:07,340 --> 00:15:10,400
And lastly, the denial of your past.

261
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:12,780
And you'll never be a success,

262
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:16,500
Kaiba, until you defeat the
monsters inside your heart.

263
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:22,100
You really kill me, you know that?

264
00:15:22,300 --> 00:15:24,020
Ha, you've lost it.

265
00:15:25,160 --> 00:15:25,990
Wrong.

266
00:15:26,073 --> 00:15:28,280
I just find you ridiculous. Come on.

267
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:30,000
I mean, lighten up, man.

268
00:15:30,220 --> 00:15:33,338
Look, you and I are fighting
a great duel right here.

269
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:35,180
So relax and have fun.

270
00:15:35,500 --> 00:15:37,160
Why don't you smile anymore?

271
00:15:37,500 --> 00:15:41,735
I know our childhood wasn't the best,
but at least we had fun sometimes.

272
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:45,857
And now you're always in a bad mood,
and I want it back the way it was.

273
00:15:45,940 --> 00:15:47,240
Those days are over.

274
00:15:47,540 --> 00:15:49,260
Ugh, they don't have to be.

275
00:15:49,500 --> 00:15:50,440
You can change.

276
00:15:50,860 --> 00:15:55,397
Instead of causing more damage, why don't
you help Yugi win and prevent more damage?

277
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:59,340
If you know the secret to
defeating Marek, then tell Yugi.

278
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:03,120
Ugh, how can I help
Yugi win my tournament?

279
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:08,080
The reason I organized the Battle City
Tournament was so I could defeat him.

280
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:12,400
Well, look who finally decided to show up.

281
00:16:12,780 --> 00:16:14,017
Is your duel over?

282
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:15,760
Yes, it's over.

283
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:19,037
What's the big idea of walking
out on me when I needed you?

284
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:20,940
It's not what you think, Joey.

285
00:16:21,340 --> 00:16:22,928
Don't worry about it, guys.

286
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:24,511
Joey got his butt kicked.

287
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:28,640
The only thing you missed was seeing
Kaiba make the poor guy squirm.

288
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:32,440
Oh, Joey, you lost your duel?

289
00:16:32,760 --> 00:16:33,800
Yes, sir.

290
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,540
Come on, Tristan.

291
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:37,308
Joey did a pretty good job.

292
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:41,240
Kaiba just did a much
better job, that's all.

293
00:16:41,640 --> 00:16:43,137
You'll get him next time.

294
00:16:43,220 --> 00:16:44,740
or the time after that.

295
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,337
Look, can we just drop it?

296
00:16:46,420 --> 00:16:48,217
Let's all focus on Yu-Gi-Oh, right?

297
00:16:48,300 --> 00:16:52,535
He's about to fight the duel of his
life against that evil freak, Marek.

298
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:01,710
Soon,

299
00:17:01,793 --> 00:17:06,920
all three Egyptian god cards will belong
to me and the world will cower at my feet.

300
00:17:07,700 --> 00:17:09,980
Ah, the pharaoh has arrived.

301
00:17:12,580 --> 00:17:15,577
He'll soon learn what
suffering is all about

302
00:17:15,660 --> 00:17:18,620
as he joins his friends
in the Shadow Realm.

303
00:17:19,200 --> 00:17:20,560
And before long,

304
00:17:20,780 --> 00:17:25,560
the boundless power of the ancient
ruler will course through my veins.

305
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:33,080
Marek, you have no idea
who you're messing with.

306
00:17:33,380 --> 00:17:35,204
Just be careful out there, Yug.

307
00:17:35,300 --> 00:17:38,241
And remember, this nutcase
plays by his own rules.

308
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:48,357
yeah just think of mine having her in
the shadow realm is bad enough but if you

309
00:17:48,440 --> 00:17:53,637
beat this freak yugi you'll save mine
not to mention the entire world i'll do

310
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:59,177
my best that fool thinks having two egyptian
god cards will give him the advantage

311
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:05,200
but even slifer and obelisk together
are no match for my winged dragon of ra

312
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:15,265
I'm afraid Yugi's chances of defeating
Marek and winning the tournament are slim.

313
00:18:15,740 --> 00:18:18,280
Marek's too tough, but as Mokuba said,

314
00:18:18,420 --> 00:18:21,891
I figured out the only way to
beat his winged dragon of Ra.

315
00:18:22,100 --> 00:18:25,320
There's one card, just
one, that can do it.

316
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:29,860
This all-powerful card lives
in my deck and my deck alone.

317
00:18:31,260 --> 00:18:34,197
But it's not just a matter
of holding this card.

318
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:37,927
It has to be played in a certain
way in order to take down Ra.

319
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:40,831
Hey, where are you going?

320
00:18:41,060 --> 00:18:43,060
To the top of my duel tower.

321
00:18:46,060 --> 00:18:48,937
Does this mean you're going
to help Yugi win, Seto?

322
00:18:49,020 --> 00:18:50,380
Just follow me.

323
00:18:54,660 --> 00:18:58,860
I could just stand by and watch
Yugi fall at the hands of Merrick.

324
00:18:59,100 --> 00:19:02,157
I have to admit, I'd
enjoy seeing Yugi lose.

325
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:04,577
But it might be interesting to see if he

326
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:07,340
has what it takes to
properly use this card.

327
00:19:11,540 --> 00:19:14,340
I hope you've made the
correct decision, Kaiba.

328
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:21,060
Raise the platform!

329
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:25,946
The final duel of the Battle City
Tournament is about to begin!

330
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:28,740
Hold on, Yugi!

331
00:19:29,820 --> 00:19:33,180
I've got something you need! Really?

332
00:19:33,460 --> 00:19:34,820
And what's that, Kaiba?

333
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:37,860
Take this!

334
00:19:41,740 --> 00:19:44,211
This is the ultimate test of Yugi's skill.

335
00:19:44,420 --> 00:19:48,980
If he plays this card correctly, there's
a slight chance he'll defeat Marek.

336
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:51,520
If not, it's all over.

337
00:19:59,980 --> 00:20:01,380
Yo,

338
00:20:01,540 --> 00:20:07,640
yo, yo
